on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 8 .............................. <8>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <8>
  [  5] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(8)>
  [  8] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 11] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(8).visible = 1
  [ 14] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 17] pusharglist 1 ........................... <7>
  [ 19] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(7)>
  [ 22] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 25] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(7).visible = 1
  [ 28] ret
end
